    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 1,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_001.mp3",
      "text": "各位早安、午安、晚安——不管你現在在哪個時區，歡迎收聽今天這一集。今天我想直接下猛藥，標題我都替你想好了，叫做〈如果你真的懂了「情」，你就會看懂整部《笑傲江湖》〉。今天我們要聊的不是武功高低，不是門派正邪，更不是誰的劍比較快，而是一個在這一回被寫到極致的核心：情，以及它如何把人一步一步逼到生死邊緣。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 2,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_002.mp3",
      "text": "等一下，我想先確認一件事。你是說這一整段，包括妓院、重傷、假死、師父追殺，真正的核心其實都不是江湖恩怨，而是情？",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 4,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_004.mp3",
      "text": "她前面真的已經快撐不住了，一直覺得是自己害死令狐沖。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 5,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_005.mp3",
      "text": "對，你注意她說的那一句話，她說自己不配做他的朋友。這句話非常重，因為那已經不是單純的自責，而是自我否定到連存在的價值都想抹掉。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 6,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_006.mp3",
      "text": "這其實跟現實生活很像。很多人在重大創傷之後，會一直回到那種如果當初怎樣就好了的迴圈。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 7,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_007.mp3",
      "text": "完全一樣。金庸在這裡寫得非常心理學。而就在儀琳情緒最低點的時候，曲非煙出現了。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 8,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_008.mp3",
      "text": "她一開始假裝自己是令狐沖，那一段我其實很不安，感覺她是在故意刺激人。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 9,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_009.mp3",
      "text": "她就是在刺激，而且是刻意的。曲非煙這個角色厲害的地方在於，她年紀小，但對人心的理解比很多大人都深。她知道儀琳心裡最痛的是什麼，所以她直接戳下去。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 10,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_010.mp3",
      "text": "所以她不是壞，而是那種硬要你正視自己內心的人。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 11,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_011.mp3",
      "text": "對，因為她背後站的是曲洋。曲洋是整部《笑傲江湖》裡，對情這件事理解得最通透的人之一。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 12,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_012.mp3",
      "text": "所以她把儀琳一路帶到妓院，其實不是惡作劇。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 13,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_013.mp3",
      "text": "完全不是。你想像那個畫面，一個小尼姑，從小只接觸清規戒律，第一次看到繡鴛鴦的錦被，第一次聞到脂粉香，第一次知道群玉院是什麼地方。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 14,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_014.mp3",
      "text": "這對她來說幾乎是信仰層級的衝擊。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 15,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_015.mp3",
      "text": "而且她真的差一點走到自殺。當她以為事情要敗露，師父要闖進來的時候，她直接拔劍往自己脖子揮。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 16,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_016.mp3",
      "text": "那一段我真的很震撼。她不是情緒化，她是真的認為只有死，才能保住門派的清白。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 17,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_017.mp3",
      "text": "對，這是出家人的戒，正面撞上人性的情。而就在這個時候，金庸做了一個關鍵安排，床上的那個人醒了。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
