      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 18,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_018.mp3",
      "text": "令狐沖。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 19,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_019.mp3",
      "text": "對，而且你注意他醒來第一句話，他不是喊痛，也不是問自己在哪，而是要人點燈。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 20,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_020.mp3",
      "text": "那一句其實很有重量，會讓人立刻感覺到這個人即使快死了，場面還是他在撐。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 21,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_021.mp3",
      "text": "這正是令狐沖的核心性格。他平時看起來隨性胡來，但關鍵時刻一定撐住。他知道現在最重要的不是自己活不活，而是儀琳不能被毀。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 22,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_022.mp3",
      "text": "所以他才讓她們躲進被窩，自己披著斗篷站起來。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 23,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_023.mp3",
      "text": "沒錯，他是在用命換一個名分上的乾淨。這件事很殘酷，但也非常俠。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 24,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_024.mp3",
      "text": "我突然理解為什麼儀琳會崩潰了。不是因為他活著，而是因為她發現自己願意為這個人承擔一切後果。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 25,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_025.mp3",
      "text": "她那句話非常狠。她說即便墮入十八重地獄，萬劫不能超生，也心甘情願。這不是浪漫的愛情宣言，而是情感被推到極限的狀態。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 26,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_026.mp3",
      "text": "那曲非煙為什麼一定要揭穿？她其實可以選擇不說。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 27,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_027.mp3",
      "text": "因為她要儀琳面對真相。她要她知道，你不是修行到無情，而是把情硬壓住。而真正的修行，是你清楚自己有多情，然後仍然選擇怎麼活下去。",
      "voice": "Kore",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 28,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_028.mp3",
      "text": "這樣看起來，這一回根本不是在治傷。",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "emotion": null,
      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "index": 29,
      "file": "output/Speaker_1_029.mp3",
      "text": "完全正確。這一回表面上叫治傷，實際上被治的，是令狐沖的身體、儀琳的心，還有整個江湖對正邪的想像。",
