      "prompt": "Say the following naturally",
      "model_used": "gemini-2.5-flash-tts",
      "language_code": "cmn-tw"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "index": 30,
      "file": "output/Speaker_2_030.mp3",
      "text": "我現在真的要收回一開始的想法。這與其說是武俠小說，不如說是一場披著武俠外衣的情感極限實驗。",
